// ============================================================== the board


/*
 * Three tests lived here and their subject is gone: `the board is reached in
 * one press`, `the front door no longer carries a block about the board`, and
 * `the board is still reachable when there is nothing on it`.
 *
 * The board-as-page layout contract collapsed the arrival page into the board, so there is nothing to
 * reach and no front door to carry a block. Everything they were protecting is
 * asserted more directly by the tests below and above: the board is what the
 * first paint draws, a board with nothing on it says how to start, and the
 * counts on it are never a debt.
 */

